  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f10fbd46a5f38064f26c717f903bccf9a05f67c1.png\" alt=\"a side scroller of the backrooms\">&nbsp;。<strong>Backrooms Retextured 是一个材质包，它将多种方块替换为来自病毒式传播的阈限恐怖网络地点“后室”的元素，旨在提供一种阈限式“伪纪录片”风格的恐怖体验，适用于建造、地图制作或类似用途。</strong>包括关卡，</p>\n<p>大厅、泳池区、宜居区、趣味关卡，</p>\n<p>以及未来可能添加的其他内容。我为这个恐怖材质包投入了大量心血，希望你们喜欢！！！（另外，如果你有任何建议，请确保在 Planet Minecraft 上留言！&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fbackrooms-retextured%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/backrooms-retextured/</a>）。<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e9bccae55ddf92cf72c304223c4448dd4141c26e.png\" alt=\"a small list of blocks from the backrooms using a normal yellow variant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3e97e759086d333edd34623088e87be970983ca5.png\" alt=\"a small list of blocks from the backrooms using a more bright variant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab291d18cad0584f6b0c614a5f9dd4209686ccfb.png\" alt=\"a small list of blocks from the backrooms using a more modern variant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d70a347a0904407d38aacb063f856ffa221d8bd.png\" alt=\"a small list of wall markings from the backrooms\"></p>",
